---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base path="/refund-policy/" cta="enroll" title="Refund & Cancellation Policy — yogine.dev" description="What happens if your plans change: refunds, rescheduling and cancellation for yogine.dev workshops.">
  <div class="page wrap">
    <div class="page-card">
      <h1 style="font-size: 1.9rem;">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <p>We want signing up to feel low-risk. Here's exactly what happens if your plans change.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 32px;">Professional and Advanced courses</h2>
      <ul class="policy-list">
        <li><strong>72 or more hours before your session:</strong> full refund, no questions asked.</li>
        <li><strong>24–71 hours before your session:</strong> 50% refund, or a full credit toward any future session of the same or a different course.</li>
        <li><strong>Can't make it within 24 hours, or missed the session?</strong> No problem — just let us know and we'll move you to the next available cohort, free of charge.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px;">Free sessions</h2>
      <p>There's nothing to refund. If you can't make it, email us so we can release your seat.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px;">Rescheduling</h2>
      <p>Need a different date instead of a refund? Just ask — moving to another upcoming session of the same course is always free, even if it's last-minute, subject to seats being available.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px;">Virtual support window</h2>
      <p>The 2 months of virtual support included with your course is part of the training itself and isn't separately refundable once your session has taken place.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px;">Enterprise training and Solutions engagements</h2>
      <p>Refund and cancellation terms for enterprise training and Solutions engagements are set out in your individual agreement with us, since scope and timelines are negotiated per organization.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px;">How to request a refund or reschedule</h2>
      <p>Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@yogine.dev?subject=Refund%20or%20reschedule%20request">hello@yogine.dev</a> with your name and the session you registered for. Approved refunds are returned to your original payment method and typically take 5–10 business days to appear, depending on your bank or card issuer.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 28px;">This policy applies to bookings made directly through yogine.dev. Team or bulk bookings arranged separately may have different terms specified in writing at the time of booking.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 36px;"><a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost">Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
